{"title":"1501.06794 Computing Functions of Random Variables via Reproducing Kernel Hilbert Space Representations","markdown":{"headingText":"1501.06794 Computing Functions of Random Variables via Reproducing Kernel Hilbert Space Representations","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Bernhard Schölkopf, Krikamol Muandet, Kenji Fukumizu, Jonas Peters / 2015-01-27 / arXiv:1501.06794\n- **一句话定位**：提出\"核概率程序设计\"（kernel probabilistic programming, KPP）——用再生核希尔伯特空间（RKHS）中的核均值嵌入（kernel mean embedding）表示随机变量的分布，使定义在样本点上的任意运算（加、乘、除、幂乃至结构方程）可以推广为定义在分布上的运算，并给出估计量与收敛速率。\n- **研究问题**：如何在不做参数假设、不显式估计密度的前提下，对取值于任意域（向量、字符串、图等）的独立随机变量 X、Y 计算并表示 f(X,Y) 的分布，且支持多步复合运算与后续统计推断。\n- **模型与方法**：分布 p 的核均值映射 µ[p]=E_{x∼p}[Φ(x)]；特征核保证单射（保留 p 的全部信息）。核心估计量：给定独立样本 x_1..x_m、y_1..y_n，用 V 统计量 (1/mn)ΣΣ Φ(f(x_i,y_j)) 估计 µ[f(X,Y)]——注意 {f(x_i,y_j)} 并非独立样本，故需专门论证一致性；多步运算用简约集（reduced set）选择/构造方法把展开压缩为 (25) 式的 Σγ_kΦ(z_k)，一般的带权估计量为 (28)。两极特例：带宽极小的高斯核退化为 Monte Carlo 抽样，线性核退化为只保留均值，中间核在两者间调节所保留的信息。\n- **主要命题/定理**：Theorem 1（引用）：经验核均值以 O(m^{−1/2}) 速率收敛。Theorem 2：对独立 RV 的可测 f，(23) 式是 µ[f(X,Y)] 的无偏一致估计，且收敛速率 O_p(1/√m + 1/√n)。Proposition 1：带权展开 Σα_iΦ(x_i) 收敛于 µ[X] 当且仅当 Σα_i²→0（在 E[k(X,X)]>E[k(X,X̃)] 下）。Theorem 3：若 (27) 型近似满足该条件，则估计量 (28) 的误差为 O_p(√Σα_i²+√Σβ_j²)。因果应用（第 4 节）：利用任何联合分布都可写成独立噪声的结构方程模型（SEM）X_i=f_i(PA_i,U_i)，递归代入得 X_i=g_i(U_1..U_p)，可用 RKHS 距离 Δ=‖µ[X_i]−µ[g_i(U_1..U_p)]‖² 检验模型；对加性噪声模型 Y=f(X)+U（X⊥⊥U），定义正向/反向分数 Δ_emp、Δ_emp^bw（(38)(39)，后者用双重循环避免残差依赖偏差），Theorem 4 证明在 ANM 方向可识别且 x 域核为特征核时 Δ_emp→0 而 Δ_emp^bw 不趋于 0，从而可判定因果方向。实验：合成数据上比较三个估计量（完整 V 统计量 μ̂1、随机子样加系数逼近 μ̂2、只用对角项的 μ̂3）在乘、除、幂三种运算下随 m=10–50 的 RKHS 误差（30 次重复，μ̂1 最佳，μ̂2 接近）；在 CauseEffectPairs 基准 81 对上用 4 次多项式回归 + 100 维随机傅里叶特征近似，全部强制决策时准确率约 80%。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：把核均值嵌入从\"分布的静态表示\"推广为\"可运算的分布数据类型\"，并为 ANM 类因果方向判定提供了不依赖显式独立性检验、直接比较分布重构误差的新一致性框架（Theorem 4），是连接核方法、结构方程模型与因果发现的桥梁性工作。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"1501.06794.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-footnotes":"脚注","section-title-references":"参考文献","section-title-reuse":"二次使用","section-title-copyright":"版权","section-title-citation":"引用格式","appendix-attribution-cite-as":"请按如下格式引用：","appendix-attribution-bibte